# ---- Old Jack's conversation ----
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.meet_arrival.text = You found the place, then. Good.\nDon't mind the head. It's a pumpkin, and it's been on there a long while. I'm Old Jack, and every autumn I come back with my lanterns while the dead are up. There's work if you want it, starting with <b>pumpkins</b>.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.meet_arrival.opt.hail = Pumpkins?
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.first_words.text = Don't mind the head. It's a pumpkin, and it's been on there a long while.\nI'm Old Jack. Every autumn the dead get restless, so I come back to the <color is="#ffd97a">Forgotten Temple</color> with my lanterns. I could use a pair of hands that aren't carved.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.first_words.opt.hail = Pleased to meet you, Jack.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.board_fresh.text = There's fresh work on my board, some for the dark and some for the daylight. It pays.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.board_fresh.opt.board = Show me the board.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.board_fresh.opt.later = Later, Jack.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.board_fresh_friendly.text = You again. Good.\nThere's fresh work on my board, and I've put a little extra up for you.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.board_fresh_honored.text = There you are. I was starting to wonder.\nThe board's full today, and I'd sooner the work went to you than anybody.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.board_fresh_revered.text = Sit a minute. The ghouls can wait.\nNot many come back to these steps night after night. The board's got work whenever you want it.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.menu.text = The lanterns are lit and the ghouls are out walking. What do you need?
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.patch_offer.text = Pick a pumpkin this month and every so often one comes up cold to the touch, glowing a little. <b>Hallowed Pumpkins</b>, I call those.\nBring me a few. I'll show you what they're good for.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.patch_offer.opt.accept = I'll find you some pumpkins.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.patch_brief.text = Any <b>pumpkin</b> you pick might come up Hallowed this month. Keep the cold ones that glow and bring them here.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.patch_ready.text = <b>Hallowed Pumpkins</b>. Cold as a cellar step. Good, these are for the lanterns.\nI've put a few Lantern Bombs in with your pay. Plain pumpkins and Boom Powder, nothing fancy. Go and see how they burn.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.patch_ready.opt.turnin = Here are the pumpkins.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.lantern_work_offer.text = A <b>Lantern Bomb</b> is a pumpkin packed with powder and a short fuse. Light it and throw it. Then stand back.\nThrow a few at something that has it coming, and come and tell me how they went.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.lantern_work_offer.opt.accept = I'll throw a few.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.ghouls_offer.text = <b>Hollow Ghouls</b> crawl out of the old graves after dark, and they come out hungry.\nPut a few of them back in the ground before they find the temple steps.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.ghouls_offer.opt.accept = I'll deal with the ghouls.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.souls_offer.text = Poor things, the <b>Lost Souls</b>. They drift about until somebody lets them go.\nSet a few free and bring me the <b>Ectoplasm</b> they leave behind. My lanterns drink the stuff.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.souls_offer.opt.accept = I'll set them free.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.geodes_offer.text = Break stone this month, any stone, and now and then a <b>Cursed Geode</b> falls out of it.\nCrack a few open. There's good in them, under the curse.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.geodes_offer.opt.accept = I'll crack some open.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.lantern_offer.text = Every year the <b>Hollow Lantern</b> goes out, and every year somebody has to light it again.\nSome of the skeletons out there wear my face. Knock a few <b>Jack Skeletons</b> down, then bring me a <b>Hallowed Pumpkin</b> and some <b>Ectoplasm</b> to fill it.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.lantern_offer.opt.accept = Let's light it.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.lantern_brief.text = <b>Jack Skeletons</b> walk at night. Knock a few down. Then a <b>Hallowed Pumpkin</b> and the <b>Ectoplasm</b>, and we light it together.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.lantern_ready.text = A <b>Hallowed Pumpkin</b>, and <b>Ectoplasm</b> to fill it to the brim. And the skeletons with my face are lying in the grass where they belong.\nHold still. There. The Hollow Lantern's lit, and it's yours to keep. Come back next year and we'll light another. Take the shield as well. It goes with the helm.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.lantern_ready.opt.turnin = Here's the pumpkin, and the Ectoplasm.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.active_generic.text = Still out there? Good. The night's long, and it isn't going anywhere.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.ready_generic.text = That looks done to me. Let's see it.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.ready_generic.opt.turnin = It's done.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.daily_souls_offer.text = More <b>Lost Souls</b> drifted in last night. Set some free before they settle in for good.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.daily_souls_offer.opt.accept = I'll see to the souls.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.daily_pumpkins_offer.text = The lanterns burn through <b>Hallowed Pumpkins</b> faster than I can carve them. Bring me a few more before dark.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.daily_pumpkins_offer.opt.accept = I'll bring pumpkins.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.daily_geodes_offer.text = Crack a couple of <b>Cursed Geodes</b> for me. My hands are too stiff for it these days.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.daily_geodes_offer.opt.accept = I'll crack a couple.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.lantern_lit.text = The Hollow Lantern's still burning. Keeps the worst of the dark off the steps.\nWhat do you need?
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.who_are_you.text = Old Jack. I kept a farm once, a long way from here. Then one October I didn't go home, and I've come back every October since.\nDon't ask me about the head.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.about_lantern.text = A Hollow Lantern's a Hallowed Pumpkin, carved out and filled with Ectoplasm. Light one and the dead keep their distance.\nThey burn out by November. That's why I need a new one every year.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.harvest_moon.text = See that moon? Harvest Moon. A few nights a year the dead get restless under it, and the graves empty out.\nIf you want work, tonight's the night. I'll be up till it sets.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.opt.returned = I'm back.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.opt.quests = What needs doing?
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.opt.board = What's on the board?
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.opt.shop = Let's see your stall.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.opt.standing = How do we stand?
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.opt.almanac = Show me the Almanac.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.opt.who = Who are you?
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.opt.lantern = What's a Hollow Lantern?
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.opt.harvest = What's a Harvest Moon?
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.opt.back = Something else.
dialogue.hallows_eve_old_jack.opt.farewell = Goodnight, Jack.

